 "about": {
  "numbers+changes": "Every limit, default, size, count, price dimension and dated change: WAF quotas (IP sets, WCUs, web ACLs, associations), body inspection limits, rate-based rule minimum and windows, Shield Advanced fee and term, Firewall Manager and Network Firewall quotas and pricing, endpoint throughput. Quote table rows with their header (saa.py tables). Change items: confirm each hypothesis against the doc-history page or the What's New page and record old value, new value and date; label anything GA after 2026-07-15 'not examinable yet'.",
  "behavior+decisions": "Can / cannot / only / by default claims and comparisons: what each service protects, where it sits, rule evaluation, actions, managed rule groups, Shield Standard vs Advanced, Firewall Manager prerequisites, policy types and scope, Network Firewall deployment, engines, domain filtering, TLS inspection, plus the neighbour comparisons and the facts behind Callvale's decision and the case studies. Displays of number-free facts are verbatim phrases of at most 8 words.",
  "faq": "Quick-fire items with verbatim FAQ answers: saa.py faq <url> --find TEXT on the four FAQ pages (parsed stores under _build/corpus/faq/). One fact per FAQ answer that a stem could turn on; skip marketing lines."
 },
